# Build output. Rebuilt from src\ by build.cmd in about a second.
bin/

# Fonts are not redistributed, with one exception.
#
# The day banner prefers Anurati (by Emmeran Richard) when it is present. That
# face is licensed for personal use only, so it must never be committed: each
# person who wants it downloads it themselves and drops it into fonts\ - see
# fonts\README.txt.
#
# Michroma is the exception. It is under the SIL Open Font License, which does
# allow bundling, and it ships as the default so the banner looks the same on
# every machine. Its licence text is fonts\Michroma-OFL.txt.
fonts/*.otf
fonts/*.ttf
fonts/*.woff
fonts/*.woff2
!fonts/Michroma-Regular.ttf

# Local scratch
*.log
*.bak
*.tmp
